{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22867","headline":"寄李相公崔侍郎钱舍人 · 白居易","name":"寄李相公崔侍郎钱舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾陪鹤驭两三仙，亲侍龙舆四五年。\n天上欢华春有限，世间漂泊海无边。\n荣枯事过都成梦，忧喜心忘便是禅。\n官满更归何处去，香炉峰在宅门前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}